# Docks by computer at Lave: launches with docking computers fitted, switches them on with D, and lets them
# fly the ship round and into the slot, to the music. It starts from docking-computer.cdr
# (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the reference's own save with the docking computer fitted, which Lave's tech
# level does not sell. D was found by probing every half second after the launch: at 6.0 s the computer docks
# soonest, because how long it waits depends on where the station's spin brings the slot.
file JAMESON.CDR docking-computer.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # D10, Disc access, on Load commander
key 1; wait 0.3                    # Load commander: the catalogue, JAMESON.CDR selected
key Return; wait 0.5               # loaded
digest loaded 8d9e5cf952fe8c41f6fe174dca1bbd6cc1971bc7f6f37efbc80420881606c4c8
